.SH DESCRIPTION

The
.B auto-autofs-nfs-setup
command configures the system to automatically mount NFS servers
discovered on the local network.

Default mount points will vary by operating system, and can be
augmented by editing configuration files such as /etc/auto_master
and /etc/autofs/*.

.SH RETURN VALUES

0 on success, non-zero error codes otherwise.

.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
.na
auto-autofs-nfs-setup
.ad
.fi

